Vee has a lot of good [[Trinket]] combinations. Some of them include:

====Survivability====
*'''{{TI|Pink Bow|name=true}}/Options''' 
**This Trinket enables Vee to outrun all [[Twisteds]] but {{CI|Twisted Pebble|name=true}} during [[Panic Mode]] {{Small|(24.2 run speed)}}. Here are some options to pair Pink Bow with:
***'''{{TI|Speedy Shoes|name=true}}''', to further increase Run Speed and outrun Twisted Pebble before Panic Mode {{Small|(25.4 run speed)}};
***'''{{TI|Vanity Mirror|name=true}}''', to outrun every Twisted except {{CI|Twisted Bobette|name=true}} or similar/higher speed Twisteds during Panic Mode and assist teammates {{Small|(31.4 run speed)}};
***'''{{TI|Diary|name=true}}''', to not interfere with 2{{Star}} [[Stealth]] Distractors;
****Only use this Trinket set if there is a distractor that meets such criteria in your team.
***'''{{TI|Train Whistle|name=true}}''', to make escaping with the {{Debuff|Slow|}}Debuff easier without losing much Stamina;
***'''{{TI|Star Pillow|name=true}}''', to regenerate [[Stamina]] faster while extracting, taking advantage of her average Stamina and fast extraction;
***The Trinkets in the '''Extraction''' section, to help with floor progression; etc.

====Extraction====
*'''{{TI|Magnifying Glass|name=true}}/Options'''
**This Trinket allows Vee to take full advantage over her 5{{Star}} [[Extraction Speed]] {{Small|(1.5 Extraction Speed)}} and 4 Star [[Skill Check]] {{Small|(134 Skill Check size)}}. Here are some options to pair Magnifying Glass with:
***'''{{TI|Vee's Remote|name=true}}''', to allow for quicker Floor progression, especially if teammates also carry Vee's Remote;
***'''{{TI|Participation Award|name=true}}''', to speed up [[Machine]] completion by maximizing Skill Check extraction, supporting her 4{{Star}} [[Skill Check]] {{Small|(19.07 avg/16.95 with Tech Savvy)}};
***'''{{TI|Stress Ball|name=true}}''', to increase Extraction Speed gradually every successful Skill Check hit;
***Any Trinkets listed in the '''Survivability/Mobility''' section, to help with mobility.

====Ability/Support====
