**'''{{TI|Sweet Charm|name=true}}''', to further reduce '''Mic Check'''<nowiki/>'s cooldown, though only by a small amount as the Trinket works with percentages {{Small|(41s)}}, especially if they're afraid a Floor will have dangerous Twisteds such as {{CI|Twisted Scraps|name=true}}, {{CI|Twisted Goob|name=true}}, or any {{Type|Main}} Twisteds.

====Other====
*'''{{TI|Spare Bulb|name=true}}''', to further increase Vee's already large light radius for maximum visibility, although it may cause some slight lag for older devices;
*'''{{TI|Party Popper|name=true}}''', to assist her during [[Blackouts]] when extracting, somewhat serving as a weaker version of {{AI|Vee|name=true}}.
